{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“指数序列”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"指数序列"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>指数序列是指紧复流形上层的正合列\n$$\r\n 0 \\to \\mathbb{Z} \\to \\mathcal O_M \\overset{\\exp}{\\to} \\mathcal O^*_M \\to 0.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"陈类","text":"陈类"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"Picard群","text":"Picard 群"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}